--
-- Directly decoded self-create states: 49 unique race/class combinations.
-- Missing self-create states caused by crashed/incomplete login sequences:
--   Dwarf Warrior, Night Elf Druid, Gnome Rogue, Gnome Priest, Orc Shaman, Undead Warlock, Skyborn Horde Warrior.
-- Their level-1 primary stats are included because the directly sniffed matrix is exactly additive by race+class (zero residual across every observed combination).
-- Items and skills for those seven incomplete self-create states are NOT invented in this file.
--
-- Item extraction is packet-derived: ActivePlayerData inventory GUID -> Item CreateObject -> ObjectData.entryId + ItemData.stackCount.
-- Inventory slot IDs are the actual ActivePlayerData invSlots indexes. Hunter ammo objects not referenced by the 105 invSlots are inserted with slotid=255 so AscEmu adds them to a free slot.
-- Skill extraction is packet-derived from the 300 x 14-byte SkillInfo array. `level` uses the sniffed SkillRank/current value.


